ne/godot-proposals/issues/15590 by providing a non-compatibility-breaking solution.\r\n- Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/12414\r\n\r\nThis PR adds new and more descriptive joypad paddle button constants and deprecates the old ones:\r\n- `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE1` -> `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE_RIGHT1`\r\n- `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE2` -> `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE_LEFT1`\r\n- `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE3` -> `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE_RIGHT2`\r\n- `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE4` -> `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE_LEFT2`\r\n\r\nThis PR uses paddle numbers instead of up/down paddles in case in the future we may need to add new paddle constants (for example, `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE_RIGHT3` and `JOY_BUTTON_PADDLE_LEFT3`).\r\n\r\nPlease let me know your opinion on the issue and this solution!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/470